3,"Dani, Upper Grand Valley in Indonesia - Joshua Project",https://joshuaproject.net/people_groups/11494,"Their language, Upper Grand Valley Dani, belongs to the Trans–New Guinea family and is widely spoken in their region. Historically, the Dani were isolated from the outside world until the mid-20th century, when explorers and missionaries first made contact.","Dani, Upper Grand Valley",Trans-New Guinea
